### Attempt to update a payment that does not exist.

PUT http://localhost:8080/payments/DOES-NOT-EXIST
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500.00,
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### 1. CREATE
### Expected: 201 Created

POST http://localhost:8080/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "Pay-DELETE-001",
  "amount": 325.00,
  "status": "PENDING"
}

###

### 2. READ
### Expected: 200 OK

GET http://localhost:8080/payments/Pay-DELETE-001

###

### 3. UPDATE
### Expected: 200 OK

PUT http://localhost:8080/payments/Pay-DELETE-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 400.00,
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

###

### 4. DELETE
### Expected: 204 No Content

DELETE http://localhost:8080/payments/Pay-DELETE-001

###

### 5. READ AFTER DELETE
### Expected: 404 Not Found

GET http://localhost:8080/payments/Pay-DELETE-001

###

### 6. DELETE AGAIN
### Expected: 404 Not Found

DELETE http://localhost:8080/payments/Pay-DELETE-001